thoughtrecipe euclo.thoughtrecipe.code_review
"Review-family recipe: gather the diff, run a react review pass, then report through the review-synthesis capability. Family defaults: read-only until the report; HITL not required for reads."

trigger as capability:
  may read workspace
  may invoke ["file_read", "grep"]
  family ["review"]

input workspace: "**/*"
input prompt: user.request

agent reviewer uses react

run reviewer:
  may invoke ["file_read", "grep", "diff_summary"]
  from input.workspace
  goal "Review the pending changes and produce findings with severity and suggested actions."
  capture result -> state.findings

route:
  otherwise:
    do relurpic:code_review on state.findings
